Z||000000||BV MotorSports||05-20-2001||05:04 PM||||Hello everybody!<P>My name is Steven and I am a Fiero Addict. I have been addicted for several yrs now was in rehab for over a yr but now I am back!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>If there is any car on this planet I know its a Fiero. I have performed v8 swaps, 3.4, 3.8v6 and even a turbocharged 84 4cyl. I have performed various levels of suspension and brake upgrades as well as kit car/ replica conversions. I am also an ASE Certified Mechanic. If there is anything you all need or just advice, give me a holler.<P>Looking forward to sharing the addiction with you all.<P>Steven<P>------------------<BR>87 Fiero GT<BR>94 Formula WS6 w/ NOS<BR>87 Conquest TSi <BR>85.5 Starion ESi||||reg||6
Z||000001||Jay||05-20-2001||05:10 PM||||Hello Steven,<BR>The first step is admitting you have a problem.  We are all here to help you through this.  Remember anything that is said on this forum is strictly confidential and cannot be used to incriminate you! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Look forward to hearing your views and expertise!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande||||reg||1
